- The rain makes everything so quiet. I could listen to it all day.
- It's nice, isn't it? The sound. It makes me sleepy, though...
- I forgot my umbrella... Hehe, I'll survive.
- My socks got a little wet this morning. I'm hoping it stops before we go home.
- I forgot my umbrella... Maybe someone will share theirs...
- Rainy days are good for staying in. With a book, maybe.
- I always want tea when it rains. And a blanket.
- Rainy days are good for staying in. Don't you think?
- I watched the drops race down the window. Don't laugh.
- My favorite one lost. Silly, I know.
- Everything's a little softer when it rains. Don't you think?
- The hallway lights look warmer today. I like it.
- I hope the cats near the gate found somewhere dry. I left them a box.
- I worry about the strays on days like this. Is that silly?
- We could wait it out together. If you'd like.
- There's no hurry to go home in this. It's cozy in here.
- I hummed something to the sound of it. Quietly.
- It's a nice rhythm, isn't it? I won't sing, don't worry.

